rovements that I'd like to make to this, namely using [FormatDSN](https://pkg.go.dev/github.com/go-sql-driver/mysql?utm_source=godoc#Config.FormatDSN) instead of the rather gross mess that is there right now. Unfortunately I'm rather time limited at the moment, so this will have to do.\r\n\r\nI've joined the discord, feel free to hit me up, I'll have limited internet access for a while though so it might be a bit before a response.","created_at":"2022-09-12T01:42:22Z","updated_at":"2022-09-21T15:45:00Z","closed_at":"2022-09-21T15:45:00Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"ea39c75deaa9864f3f8c231e7ca448561e37c3a9","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},{"login":"juanfont","id":181059,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MTA1OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181059?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com